    correctAnswerVoice: {fileID: 8300000, guid: cd01db94c85f0eb409db86289b23b4ae, type: 3}
  - questionText: Which is a common feature of arid soil?
    options:
    - High humus
    - Very high moisture
    - Sandy texture and low moisture
